<section id="bbs024" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>A two-by-two of subtle boxes under a working title, each quadrant a short title and one or two sentences, all four the same shape; the axes live in the title.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="WMOLYg5lIx"><h2>Risks by likelihood and impact</h2><grid vertical-sizing="fill" spacing="small"><grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" id="SKLbWV5MdK"><p font-size="sm"><b>Likely · High impact</b></p><h4>Hiring for the second shift slips</h4><p>Six roles in a tight local market; overtime covers the gap at a cost to margin.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" id="MhAA4Gx-Er"><p font-size="sm"><b>Unlikely · High impact</b></p><h4>A top-five account leaves</h4><p>Standing schedules reduce the risk; the account review flags any drop in order frequency.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" id="t3h3kZwrs9"><p font-size="sm"><b>Likely · Low impact</b></p><h4>New-line stock arrives late</h4><p>Two weeks of buffer stock is reserved at the depot for the launch month.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle" id="1oFcs7hmlP"><p font-size="sm"><b>Unlikely · Low impact</b></p><h4>Fuel costs rise sharply</h4><p>Routes are fixed for the quarter; a surcharge clause covers sustained increases.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>